---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import coverage from '../data/image-coverage.json';
---
<Base title="Image search | Litbuy Sheet Lab"><main class="image-search-page"><p class="eyebrow">LITBUY SHEET LAB</p><h1 data-home-aria="image_search">Image search</h1><p>Choose a product image to find visually similar products. Your image stays in your browser.</p><div class="upload-box"><label id="image-upload-label" for="image-upload">Choose an image</label><input id="image-upload" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"/><p>JPG · PNG · WebP · 15 MB</p><p id="image-search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><p class="data-note">{coverage.indexedImages.toLocaleString('en-US')} of {coverage.sourceImages.toLocaleString('en-US')} source images have usable descriptors. Missing or unavailable images may not match. Similarity compares small image descriptors and is approximate.</p><div class="image-search-info"><h2>Visually similar products</h2><p>After selecting an image, results open in the Litbuy Sheet Lab product list, ordered by approximate visual similarity.</p></div></main></Base>